; Item action: cross that can be taken while the wheel is at rest
;
; The other set of crosses (see #R$A777). If Jean touches the cross while the wheel state bits at #R$851E are 0 it is
; taken (#R$A78B); otherwise it is animated and drawn by the code at #R$A799, using frame offset 0 (bright cross) when
; the wheel is at rest and 6 (thin cross) when it is turned.
;
; F Carry set when Jean's box overlaps the item's box
@label=ActionCrossWheelRest
c$A782 JR NC,$A799   ;
 $A784 LD A,($851E)  ;
@isub=AND WHEEL_STATE_MASK
 $A787 AND $07       ;
 $A789 JR NZ,$A799   ; wheel turned: not takeable
